{"description":"Dependency DAG for the 50 deep low-level plugins (feat/deep-lowlevel-50). Layer 0 parsers produce structured artifacts; layer 1 analyzers consume them; layer 2 correlators combine analyzer outputs; layer 3 is the harness evidence pack and the live-probe validator. Edges name the artifact that flows. A plugin runs only after its layer-0 inputs are present (or degrades honestly when they are absent). Simulation-only producers (erc4337 paymaster simulator, anchor discriminator fuzzer) emit UNVERIFIED candidates only; the live eth_call probe is the only proof path.","edges":[{"artifact":"verified_code_sections","from":"eof_container_code_section_verifier","to":"evm_cfg_basic_block_reconstructor"},{"artifact":"cfg_blocks","from":"evm_cfg_basic_block_reconstructor","to":"symbolic_z3_storage_taint_tracer"},{"artifact":"cfg_blocks","from":"evm_cfg_basic_block_reconstructor","to":"zeroday_exploit_chain"},{"artifact":"cfg_blocks","from":"evm_cfg_basic_block_reconstructor","to":"business_logic_invariants"},{"artifact":"tainted_slots","from":"symbolic_z3_storage_taint_tracer","to":"zeroday_exploit_chain"},{"artifact":"tainted_slots","from":"symbolic_z3_storage_taint_tracer","to":"auto_validator"},{"artifact":"selector_tree","from":"diamond_erc2535_facet_selector_tree","to":"zeroday_exploit_chain"},{"artifact":"selector_tree","from":"diamond_erc2535_facet_selector_tree","to":"auto_validator"},{"artifact":"transient_slots","from":"transient_storage_tstore_lifecycle_auditor","to":"zeroday_exploit_chain"},{"artifact":"transient_slots","from":"transient_storage_tstore_lifecycle_auditor","to":"business_logic_invariants"},{"artifact":"paymaster_drain_shape","from":"erc4337_entrypoint_paymaster_simulator","to":"zeroday_exploit_chain"},{"artifact":"paymaster_drain_shape","from":"erc4337_entrypoint_paymaster_simulator","to":"auto_validator"},{"artifact":"hook_graph","from":"erc7579_modular_account_hook_inspector","to":"zeroday_exploit_chain"},{"artifact":"vk_audit","from"